mage link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">S_EPI_Letter_ValeriaDevellaNotMet</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:S_EPI_Letter_ValeriaDevellaNotMet\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:S_EPI_Letter_ValeriaDevellaNotMet\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UUID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">1e841e73-328f-48ac-8f95-a84ff7466314</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:1e841e73-328f-48ac-8f95-a84ff7466314\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:1e841e73-328f-48ac-8f95-a84ff7466314\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></li></ul>\n</div>   \n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n    <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>Within the <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Chest_of_Grateful_Words\" title=\"Chest of Grateful Words\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8a/Jeweled_Chest_A_Unfaded_Icon.webp/20px-Jeweled_Chest_A_Unfaded_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/8a/Jeweled_Chest_A_Unfaded_Icon.webp/30px-Jeweled_Chest_A_Unfaded_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/8a/Jeweled_Chest_A_Unfaded_Icon.webp/40px-Jeweled_Chest_A_Unfaded_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8a/Jeweled_Chest_A_Unfaded_Icon.webp/20px-Jeweled_Chest_A_Unfaded_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/8a/Jeweled_Chest_A_Unfaded_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Chest_of_Grateful_Words\" title=\"Chest of Grateful Words\">Chest of Grateful Words</a></li></ul>\n</div>  <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Text\"> Text </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-book-text\">\n<dl><dd><i>If Devella Fountainhead was met and helped</i> (<details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">S_EPI_Letter_ValeriaDevellaAlive</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:S_EPI_Letter_ValeriaDevellaAlive\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:S_EPI_Letter_ValeriaDevellaAlive\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> / <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UUID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">97ac3b36-f12e-4f18-aa1b-ab37e6a3a625</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:97ac3b36-f12e-4f18-aa1b-ab37e6a3a625\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:97ac3b36-f12e-4f18-aa1b-ab37e6a3a625\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span>):</dd></dl>\n<p>Salutations!\n</p><p><br>\nI'm writing to request your help in a mysterious case that has arisen since our little Bhaalian bash a half-year ago. Regrettably, I've had to take the credit for dispelling the Bhaal cult (in your absence, you understand), and am working on routing the remaining Bhaalists from our fair city (with the newly promoted Blaze Devella Fountainhead in tow, of course). This has made me a <i>target</i>. A false document bringing my name into ill-repute has been made public - an alleged unpaid bar tab at the Elfsong. If you happen to be passing through with a bindle of coin, perhaps you can persuade management of my obvious innocence? Much obliged.\n</p><p><br>\nInvestigator Valeria - Sleuth of Helm.\n</p><p><br>\nPS. Any advice on getting Bhaalist blood out of cloth? My hat's not been the same since the Murder Tribunal.\n</p>\n<dl><dd><i>If Devella Fountainhead was met and died</i> (<details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">S_EPI_Letter_ValeriaDevellaDead</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:S_EPI_Letter_ValeriaDevellaDead\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:S_EPI_Letter_ValeriaDevellaDead\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> / <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UUID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">c874a51a-71f3-44c8-8d43-532bdf918d07</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:c874a51a-71f3-44c8-8d43-532bdf918d07\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:c874a51a-71f3-44c8-8d43-532bdf918d07\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span>):</dd></dl>\n<p>Salutations!\n</p><p><br>\nI'm writing to request your help in a mysterious case that has arisen since our little Bhaalian bash a half-year ago. Regrettably, I've had to take the credit for dispelling the Bhaal cult (in your absence, you understand), and am working on routing the remaining Bhaalists from our fair city. This has made me a <i>target</i>. A false document bringing my name into ill-repute has been made public - an alleged unpaid bar tab at the Elfsong. If you happen to be passing through with a bindle of coin, perhaps you can persuade management of my obvious innocence? Much obliged.\n</p><p><br>\nInvestigator Valeria - Sleuth of Helm.\n</p><p><br>\nPS. I wrangled Devella a posthumous promotion to Blaze Fountainhead - she deserved that at least.\n</p>\n<dl><dd><i>If Devella Fountainhead was never met</i> (<details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">S_EPI_Letter_ValeriaDevellaNotMet</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:S_EPI_Letter_ValeriaDevellaNotMet\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:S_EPI_Letter_ValeriaDevellaNotMet\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> / <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UUID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">1e841e73-328f-48ac-8f95-a84ff7466314</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:1e841e73-328f-48ac-8f95-a84ff7466314\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:1e841e73-328f-48ac-8f95-a84ff7466314\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span>):</dd></dl>\n<p>Salutations!\n</p><p><br>\nI'm writing to request your help in a mysterious case that has arisen since our little Bhaalian bash a half-year ago. Regrettably, I've had to take the credit for dispelling the Bhaal cult (in your absence, you understand), and am working on routing the remaining Bhaalists from our fair city. This has made me a <i>target.</i> A false document bringing my name into ill-repute has been made public - an alleged unpaid bar tab at the Elfsong. If you happen to be passing through with a bindle of coin, perhaps you can persuade management of my obvious innocence? Much obliged.\n</p><p><br>\nInvestigator Valeria - Sleuth of Helm.\n</p><p><br>\nPS. Any advice on getting Bhaalist blood out of cloth? My hat's not been the same since the Murder Tribunal.\n</p>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>Contingent on Valeria surviving through <a href=\"/wiki/Act_Three\" title=\"Act Three\">Act Three</a>.</li></ul>\n</div>   \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714234327\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.079 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.083 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 3225/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 91983/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 34464/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 29/200\nExpensive parser function count: 3/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.023/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1187907/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   65.226      1 Template:MiscItemPage\n100.00%   65.226      1 -total\n 54.19%   35.349     10 Template:Icon_text\n 52.75%   34.405     39 Template:Trim\n 37.86%   24.692     12 Template:Uid\n 18.17%   11.849      1 Template:PageSeo\n 18.10%   11.805      2 Template:Hidden_code\n 16.47%   10.745      6 Template:Uuid\n 15.71%   10.249      2